<article class="election-results" data-pagefind-body>
  <h1>November 3, 2026 results</h1>
  <p class="results-status">{% if election2026.resultsListed %}Travis County unofficial count, updated {{ election2026.checkedAt | centralTime }} Nov. 4. Counting may continue. Parts of Austin and the ACC district lie in Williamson and Hays counties, whose votes are not included. <a href="{{ election2026.measures[0].result.source }}">{{ election2026.measures[0].result.sourceLabel }}</a>.{% else %}Results not posted yet. Travis County posts them after polls close at 7 p.m. Last checked: {{ election2026.checkedAt | centralTime }} Central. <a href="{{ election2026.links.resultsPage }}">{{ election2026.links.resultsPageLabel }}</a>. <a href="{{ election2026.links.resultsEnr }}">{{ election2026.links.resultsEnrLabel }}</a>.{% endif %}</p>
  <p>Voting for November 3, 2026, is over. See the count status above for the county results link. <a href="{{ election2026.links.sosDates }}">{{ election2026.links.sosDatesLabel }}</a>. <a href="{{ election2026.links.currentElection }}">{{ election2026.links.currentElectionLabel }}</a>.</p>
  <p>The county voter lookup shows the ballot for an address. <a href="{{ election2026.links.voterLookup }}">{{ election2026.links.voterLookupLabel }}</a>.</p>
  <p>No endorsements. The ballot and the dates are on <a href="/vote-2026/">Vote 2026</a>.</p>

  <h2>Measures</h2>
  {% for measure in election2026.measures %}
  <section class="measure" id="{{ measure.id }}">
    <h3>{{ measure.ballotTitle }}</h3>
    <p>{{ measure.summary }}. <a href="{{ measure.source }}">{{ measure.sourceLabel }}</a>.</p>
    {% if measure.result.yes != null and measure.result.no != null %}
    <p>For {{ measure.result.yes | commas }}. Against {{ measure.result.no | commas }}.</p>
    {% if measure.result.limitedPurposeYes != null and measure.result.limitedPurposeNo != null %}
    <p class="limited-purpose">Limited-purpose area: For {{ measure.result.limitedPurposeYes | commas }}, Against {{ measure.result.limitedPurposeNo | commas }}.</p>
    {% endif %}
    {% if measure.result.outcome %}
    <p>{{ measure.result.outcome }}.</p>
    {% endif %}
    {% else %}
    <p class="status">Not posted yet.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
  {% endfor %}
</article>
